     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"BPMN-01\"> </a></b>Create BPMN 2.0 diagrams</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create business process diagrams following the BPMN 2.0 standard.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BPMN-02\"> </a></b>Create overview process diagram</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create an overview diagram reflecting all key business processes for the health area.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BPMN-03\"> </a></b>Create detailed workflow annotations</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create detailed workflow annotations for each identified business process with activities, decision points, and interactions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BPMN-04\"> </a></b>Apply 80/20 generalization rule</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can ensure workflows capture 80% of the scenario, leaving 20% for country-level adaptation.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BPMN-05\"> </a></b>Use swimlanes for personas</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can assign activities to the correct persona swimlanes in BPMN diagrams.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"BPMN-06\"> </a></b>Identify sub-processes</td><td>SHOULD</td><td><div><p>Can identify repeating activities and refactor them into sub-processes or referenced business processes.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BPMN-01\"> </a></b>Create BPMN 2.0 diagrams</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create business process diagrams following the BPMN 2.0 standard.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BPMN-02\"> </a></b>Create overview process diagram</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create an overview diagram reflecting all key business processes for the health area.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BPMN-03\"> </a></b>Create detailed workflow annotations</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create detailed workflow annotations for each identified business process with activities, decision points, and interactions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BPMN-04\"> </a></b>Apply 80/20 generalization rule</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can ensure workflows capture 80% of the scenario, leaving 20% for country-level adaptation.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BPMN-05\"> </a></b>Use swimlanes for personas</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can assign activities to the correct persona swimlanes in BPMN diagrams.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-BPMN-06\"> </a></b>Identify sub-processes</td><td>SHOULD</td><td><div><p>Can identify repeating activities and refactor them into sub-processes or referenced business processes.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.AuthorBusinessProcesses\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.BusinessAnalyst.html\">Business Analyst</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BPMN-01\"> </a></b>Create BPMN 2.0 diagrams</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create business process diagrams following the BPMN 2.0 standard.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BPMN-02\"> </a></b>Create overview process diagram</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create an overview diagram reflecting all key business processes for the health area.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BPMN-03\"> </a></b>Create detailed workflow annotations</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can create detailed workflow annotations for each identified business process with activities, decision points, and interactions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BPMN-04\"> </a></b>Apply 80/20 generalization rule</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Can ensure workflows capture 80% of the scenario, leaving 20% for country-level adaptation.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-BPMN-05\"> </a></b>Use swimlanes for personas</td><td>SHALL</td><td><di